Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Type "demo passphrase"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "th status"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
Type "clear"
Enter
Type "terms_history_enable"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "ts -n TODO src"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "tl --long"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "clear"
Enter
Type "th search TODO"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3500ms
